Description:
 sophomorix-belwue-mail - Reading external Mail data at Belwue and suggest actions
 sophomorix-developer - Test suite for sophomorix-samba
 sophomorix-dump - Migration dump script
 sophomorix-samba - Sophomorix for Samba 4
 sophomorix-vampire - Migration vampire script
Changes:
 sophomorix4 (1:7.4.8~edu) lmn74; urgency=high
 .
   * Merge upstream 7.4.8 (security release). Upstream notes:
   * [security] [sophomorix-exam-mode] --subdir is validated, and the
     commands are run without shell.
   * [sophomorix-passwd] --random is refused for users of a file with
     dice passwords.
   * edulution fork: this build keeps the read_ui change of 1:7.4.7~edu,
     which skips the webui permissions when their file is missing.
